<title>USA: MCB Financial Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>MCB Financial Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAN RAFAEL, Calif., Feb 3 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		    1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr  profit     $0.34	  profit  $0.24</p>
<p> Net  profit     322	    profit  225</p>
<p>	   YEAR</p>
<p> Shr  profit     2.08	  oper loss1.66</p>
<p> Net  profit     1,971	 oper loss1,498</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note -  Results for 1996 reflect, in conjunction with the settlement of its outstanding litigation, the recovery of approximately $1.8 million (pretax) in litigation expenses recorded during 1995.</p>
<p>The net operating loss during 1995 resulted from the creation of a $2.8 million (pretax) litigation settlement reserve in second quarter of that year.</p>
